msgid ""
"FreeSWITCH is a **C Autotools** softswitch. There is no `package.json` / "
"`go.mod` / `Cargo.toml` for the product. `scripts/gen_tech_stack.py` only"
" found the **PKB Sphinx** manifests under `man/` (see `_generated/02"
"-tech-stack.generated.md`). Product versions below come from "
"`configure.ac` `PKG_CHECK_MODULES` / `AC_CHECK_LIB` floors and from "
"bundled `libs/` headers."
msgstr ""
"FreeSWITCH 是 **C Autotools** 软交换。产品没有 `package.json` / `go.mod` / "
"`Cargo.toml`。`scripts/gen_tech_stack.py` 只在 `man/` 下找到了 **PKB Sphinx** "
"清单（见 `_generated/03-tech-stack.generated.md`）。下文产品版本来自 `configure.ac` 的 "
"`PKG_CHECK_MODULES` / `AC_CHECK_LIB` 下限，以及捆绑的 `libs/` 头文件。"

