#: 6591810270b646a9bb92eda6835a7f8e
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A threaded C core (`libfreeswitch`) plus loadable DSOs implement "
"SIP/WebRTC switching, RTP, dialplan, and ESL. DSOs **register** named C "
"interfaces into core hashes at load; they are not described by an IDL "
"([Architecture — Loadable module contract](01-architecture.md#loadable-"
"module-contract)). System libraries (Sofia-SIP, SpanDSP, OpenSSL, libks) "
"and a few vendored trees (`libs/apr`, `libs/srtp`, `libs/libvpx`, …) "
"provide portability, crypto, and codecs."
msgstr ""
"带线程的 C 核心（`libfreeswitch`）加上可加载 DSO，实现 SIP/WebRTC 交换、RTP、拨号计划和 ESL。系统库"
"（Sofia-"
"SIP、SpanDSP、OpenSSL、libks）以及若干内嵌树（`libs/apr`、`libs/srtp`、`libs/libvpx`、…）提供可移植性、加密和编解码器。"

