msgid ""
"**Core** runs the channel state machine; **XML dialplan** "
"(`mod_dialplan_xml`) picks applications."
msgstr "**核心**运行通道状态机；**XML 拨号计划**（`mod_dialplan_xml`）选择应用。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/02-tech-stack.md:274
#: b90e77d22d024776b1501a905982ad20
msgid ""
"**Applications** (dptools, conference, …) bridge or play media; "
"**codecs** and **libSRTP/OpenSSL** handle RTP."
msgstr "**应用**（dptools、conference、…）桥接或播放媒体；**编解码器**和 **libSRTP/OpenSSL** 处理 RTP。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/02-tech-stack.md:275
#: 6b83195f7d3c475b9ce48b8b8b0d3868
msgid ""
"**Events** go to the in-process bus; **ESL** clients and CDR modules "
"consume them. **SQLite** holds core scoreboard unless `-nosql`."
msgstr "**事件**进入进程内总线；**ESL** 客户端和 CDR 模块消费它们。除非 `-nosql`，**SQLite** 保存核心记分板。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/02-tech-stack.md:277
#: ce79bed579764eaf90b1d00763785dc1
msgid ""
"Layers do **not** talk over HTTP internally. The process is the unit of "
"composition; DSOs register interface tables."
msgstr "各层内部**不**通过 HTTP 通信。进程是组合单元；DSO 注册接口表。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/02-tech-stack.md:279
#: 5a81f80e69764a4995bf968d954db000
