#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**CI**: `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (Debian bookworm-amd64 base "
"`signalwire/freeswitch-public-ci-base`), `macos.yml` (Homebrew + "
"`signalwire/homebrew-signalwire/{libks2,signalwire-c2,spandsp}`), "
