"signalwire/{libks2,signalwire-c2,spandsp}`）、`windows.yml`、`scan-"
"build.yml`（clang-14）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/02-tech-stack.md:283
#: 8b60a695c2b3494eaa62684a9c397a45
msgid ""
"**Production / distro**: Debian packages via FSGET/FSDEB "
"(`scripts/packaging/`); module `Build-Depends` in `debian/control-"
"modules` (Bookworm vs Trixie ffmpeg package names differ). Docker "
"packaged images need a SignalWire token (`docker/master/Dockerfile`); "
"source image recipe is `docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile`."
msgstr ""
"**生产 / 发行版**：通过 FSGET/FSDEB 打 Debian 包（`scripts/packaging/`）；模块 `Build-"
"Depends` 在 `debian/control-modules`（Bookworm 与 Trixie 的 ffmpeg "
"包名不同）。Docker 打包镜像需要 SignalWire token（`docker/master/Dockerfile`）；源码镜像配方为 "
"`docker/examples/Debian11/Dockerfile`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/02-tech-stack.md:284
